  %% QUESTION THIS DIAGRAM ANSWERS: When do control, internal audit, COA and oversight operate?
  %% SOURCES: [PD1445] [CONST] [COA-GAS] organizational roles vary
  %% SCOPE: Reference view; not a verified deployed system interface.
  %% READING: Arrows show possible evidence, authority or event dependencies, not a universal time order or verified API.
flowchart LR
  ACTION["Operational decision / financial event"] --> MGT["Agency management controls before, during and after transaction"]
  MGT --> BOOK["Accountability records and reconciliations"]
  BOOK --> INT["Internal audit / evaluation as separately mandated"]
  BOOK --> COA["COA independent audit - financial, compliance, performance"]
  COA --> FIND["Observations, findings, notices and reports"]
  FIND --> RESP["Agency reply, correction, appeal or recovery as applicable"]
  RESP --> MON["Follow-up and residual risk"]
  COA --> LEG["Congress and public oversight"]
  MON -.-> MGT
  LEG -.-> MGT
